fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"gstreamer/gstelement.html#GST_ELEMENT_FLOW_ERROR_WITH_LOG_CTX","fragment":"\n\tGST_ELEMENT_FLOW_ERROR_WITH_LOG_CTX\n\nUtility function that elements can use in case they encountered a fatal\ndata processing error due to wrong flow processing.\nParameters:\nthe element that generates the error\nthe log context\nthe GstFlowReturn leading to that ERROR message\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\n"});